# Every fixture here is generated from its journal's exact bytes, and in some
# journals a carriage return is the point of the test. Without -text a checkout
# or a commit that normalises line endings would hand the test an LF file, and
# it would pass without testing anything. The pattern covers every journal so
# that a new one cannot be left out.
Tests/SwiftLedgerTests/Conformance/*.journal -text
